      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} please note that there is variation between this issue and the issue of mine merged, indicating a wider issue as a whole.\n\nMy issue occurs with spout on, stream camera, UI dismissed, in *desktop* mode, and occurs because _VRChatCameraMode is 0 *when it shouldn't be,* rather than it being non-zero when it shouldn't. Effectively, the complete opposite.",
